# An uncaptured drag from A (x 0..100, y 0..40) to B (x 100..200), in
# the wrapper (3D 1c PR 5): B gets the move and the release, A the
# press only, and the click is the nearest common ancestor's.
listen pointerdown pointermove pointerup pointercancel click
move 50 20                    over A
expect event pointermove div#a
press 50 20                   A, which does not capture
expect event pointerdown div#a
move 150 20                   over B, not captured
expect event pointermove div#b
release 150 20                on B
expect event pointerup div#b
expect event click div#wrap
